            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This paper explores relationships between Southeast Asian refugee families, with particular interests in the function of care on both a state and interpersonal level. By engaging with personal memories from myself, my mother, and my grandmother, my project affirms various means for care-building amongst multigenerational families.",
